        "text": "Specifying type\nWe can limit the possibility of errors by specifying the type of the parameter in the same way as we\nspecify the type of a variable, by typing the attribute before the variable. In your script, replace the\n$City = \"London\" line with this:\n[String]$City = \"London\"\nNow, whatever we pass in the -City parameter will be cast to a string.",
